<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - StorMedia rated neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - StorMedia rated neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley initiated coverage of StorMedia Inc with a neutral rating.</p>
<p>-- Analyst was not immedidiately available to comment.</p>
<p>-- Shares fell 3/4 to 12 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
